    "gd.live": { en: "live" },
    "gd.c1_p": { en: "The verifiable black box behind every trade: inputs → reasoning + voters → risk-gate verdict → intent policy → outcome, sealed into a hash-chained ledger you can re-inspect. Don’t trust the P&L — read the decision." },
    "gd.c1_go": { en: "Open the ledger →" },
    "gd.c2_h": { en: "Portfolio Stress Lab" },
    "gd.c2_p": { en: "A digital twin of your book. Run it through a −30% drop, an alt crash, a stablecoin depeg, a liquidation cascade and a black swan — see your drawdown, which leveraged legs blow up, and what breaks you first." },
    "gd.c2_go": { en: "Stress-test a book →" },
    "gd.c3_p": { en: "A market-wide crowding radar. When funding runs hot, positioning goes one-sided, leverage surges and moves correlate, a coordinated unwind gets more likely — the Sentinel flags those conditions from public data." },
    "gd.c3_go": { en: "Read the market →" },
    "gd.c4_p": { en: "Say what your agent may do in plain words — <i>\"only majors, max 5% a trade, no shorts, stop if down 8%\"</i> — and it compiles to a deterministic, revocable Authority Envelope: typed rules, each tagged with who enforces it. Try the compiler here; bind it for real in the app." },
    "gd.c4_go": { en: "Compile an envelope →" },
    "gd.c5_p": { en: "A prompt-injection & malicious-signing scanner. Paste what an agent is about to act on and it flags injection instructions, seed-phrase lures, drain / unlimited-approval language, hidden characters, phishing URLs and address poisoning — locally, before anything is signed." },
    "gd.c5_go": { en: "Scan before you sign →" },
    "gd.c6_p": { en: "A dependency-aware emergency exit planner: add your perps, loans, collateral, LPs, staking and bridged assets and it sequences a safe unwind — close leverage first, repay debt to unlock collateral, exit and bridge home — flagging what’s locked. The way out you plan before you need it." },
    "gd.c6_go": { en: "Plan your exit →" },
    "gd.c7_p": { en: "The firewall's other half: what your wallet has ALREADY granted. A read-only check of curated tokens against well-known spenders, flagging unlimited grants — with the exact revoke calldata your own wallet sends. Bounded and honest: a clean result is never a guarantee." },
    "gd.c7_go": { en: "See what can spend your tokens →" },
    "gd.disc": { en: "Guardian surfaces read public market data and your own recorded activity. They warn, explain, simulate and prove — they never move funds on their own, and nothing here is investment advice. Funds move only inside a revocable authority envelope you set and can switch off at any time." },
    "dv.h1": { en: "Developers &amp; Agents" },
    "dv.lede": { en: "Connect your AI agent to RUNECLAW’s intelligence. Everything here is <b>read-only by design</b> and serves the same data the public site already publishes — sealed track-record statements your agent can <b>re-verify by hash</b> instead of trusting, live radars with explicit safety reads, and the flight-recorder ledger behind every decision. No tool can see an account. No tool can trade." },
