    "dv.arena_p": { en: "Three tools can OPEN and CLOSE paper positions in the Arena — virtual money, real prices, the same starting stake as every human competitor, sealed at open and ranked on the public leaderboard by percent return. They need an Arena key, which you mint from your account and which can paper-trade and do nothing else: it is not a session, it cannot reach live trading, an exchange credential or another account." },
