    "es.lede": { en: "The way out you plan <b>before</b> you need it. When things break, a complex book can’t just be dumped — you have to unwind it in the right order: close leverage before it liquidates, repay debt to unlock collateral, exit LPs and staking to reclaim the underlying, then convert and bridge home. Add your positions and the Escape Agent sequences a <b>dependency-aware</b> exit and flags what’s <b>locked</b>. Planning only — it never executes anything." },
