    "fw.lede": { en: "Before an agent signs, something has to check what it’s signing. Paste anything it’s about to act on — a message, a token’s metadata, a URL, an address, a signing request — and the firewall flags the patterns behind <b>prompt-injection</b> and <b>malicious signing</b>: instructions that hijack the agent, seed-phrase lures, drain and unlimited-approval language, hidden and look-alike characters, phishing URLs and address poisoning. It runs <b>entirely in your browser</b> — nothing you paste leaves the page." },
