    "av.hon_h": { en: "What this is — and is not" },
    "av.hon_p": { en: "<b>Bounded by construction:</b> only the curated majors on each chain are checked, and only against well-known spenders (Permit2, 1inch, 0x, Seaport, and — where its bytecode really is the router — Uniswap's SwapRouter02). Approvals to anything outside this registry are <b>not scanned</b>, so a clean result is <b>never a guarantee</b>. A pair that can't be read is counted as unreadable, never shown as zero. UNLIMITED means the grant exceeds 2¹²⁸ — the same threshold the transaction X-ray uses, so both halves of the firewall agree." },
